# API routes (Resolve)

See [frontend/app/api/AGENTS.md](../../frontend/app/api/AGENTS.md).

- Thin handlers: parse → delegate to `lib/<domain>/`.
- Zod `safeParse` inline on JSON bodies; no generic JSON helpers or `as Type` casts.
- User routes: `createClient()` + `getUser()`; org via `requireOrganizationId` / `tryRequireOrganizationId`.
- Cron routes: `assertCronAuthorized` then `isCronInvocation` for admin mode.
- Slack routes: `verifySlackRequest` before any mutation.
- Errors: `{ error: string }` JSON with correct status codes.
- No backward-compatible dual request shapes; delete obsolete endpoints instead.
